# Source checkout: keep code, manifests, lockfiles, configuration and source data.
# Documentation, media, generated output and local work records stay local.
# Ignore rules apply to untracked files; tracked files keep their Git history.

# Documentation and external reference copies
docs/
doc/
documentation/
/references/
/md/
